Apple today <a href="https://www.apple.com/retail/carlsbad/">announced</a> that its retail store at The Forum in Carlsbad, California will be reopening in its original location on Friday, November 20 at 10 a.m. local time, following <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2025/10/10/apple-carlsbad-temporary-store/">more than a year of renovations</a>. Additions will likely include a Genius Bar with accessible seating and a dedicated Apple Pickup area for online orders.<br/>
<br/>
